# All of .scaffolding/ is ignored in this plugin repo (dev scaffolding). The
# auto-ingest runtime artefacts below live in *user* projects, not here; listed
# explicitly to document that .ingest-* are ephemeral (log.md is NOT ignored —
# it is git-tracked in consuming projects).
.scaffolding/
.scaffolding/.ingest-dirty
.scaffolding/.ingest-queue
.scaffolding/.ingest-seen
.scaffolding/.noingest
# Per-user SOFA (Stack Overflow for Agents) credentials — each user supplies their own key
.sofa/
